`Matlab_originals` contains the original `.mat` files downloaded from the public repository. We provide only the files corresponding to the mouse analyzed in this study, named `M3424F`.

The directory contains the auxiliary file `order_lookup_M2434_F.csv` and the folder `M3424`. The latter includes `behav.mat` and `neuronIndividuals_new.mat`, the original MATLAB files containing data from all six trials for mouse `M3424F`. It also contains the `RDS_by_trial` folder, which stores the complete data separately for each of the six trials. For a description of the structure of these files, refer to the previous object description.

In the paper, we focus specifically on the fourth trial.
